    "CoopIII does not rehost anybody's work unless their licence says it may.",
    "A download comes from its authors' own release first; `mirrors` are copies",
    "of the same file in CoopIII's own GitHub release, and exist only for MIT",
    "components. Whichever source answers, the file is kept only if its SHA-256",
    "is the one written here.",
    "",
    "To get a sha256:  certutil -hashfile <file> SHA256",
    "",
    "downgrader is where a player whose gta3.exe has no patch (the Steam one)",
    "is sent: pages that explain downgrading your own copy, never a file host",
    "or a direct download. The Setup refuses a url that looks like a file."
